"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Sustainable Architecture","Green Certification","BIM","Building Performance","Energy Modelling","Carbon/LCA","Data Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Rather than positioning yourself simply as an “architect interested in sustainability,” aim to become a measurable building-performance and sustainability professional who can demonstrate how a design reduces energy, water, carbon, material impact, and operational costs."}]}]}